---
title: Reception
---
body:

Reception
-----------

We encourage everyone to drop by on Friday evening for the conference reception. You’ll have a chance to get acquainted with each other over some refreshments, and pick up your badge so you can skip the line in the morning. Note that we are not able to accommodate additional guests at this event.

Logistics
~~~~~~~~~

See the `Schedule </schedule>`_ for information on the exact date and time. The venue is the same as the conference: Revolution Hall, 300 SE Stark Street, Portland, OR 97214.
